```js
const tribonacci = (n) => {
  if (n === 0 || n === 1) return 0;

  if (n === 2) return 1;

  return tribonacci(n - 1) + tribonacci(n - 2) + tribonacci(n - 3);
};
```

- Time: O(3^n)
- Space: O(n)



#### memoized (pass)

```js
const tribonacci = (n, memo = {}) => {
  if (n in memo) return memo[n];

  if (n === 0 || n === 1) return 0;

  if (n === 2) return 1;

  memo[n] = tribonacci(n - 1, memo) + tribonacci(n - 2, memo) + tribonacci(n - 3, memo);
  return memo[n];
};
```

- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)

